Subject: [PATCH] Add Axis product page at /axis

- New page at regentplatform.com/axis describing Axis's shipped modules
  (invoicing, ledger accounting, inventory/custody, HR & attendance,
  team roles, multi-org)
- Uses existing design system components (SectionHeader, RevealOnScroll,
  PageMeta, Icons) to match the /pricing page style
- Added to primary nav
- Added to sitemap.ts
---
